[[8,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025001\">1016A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3024759\">1008C10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3024947\">1008C14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025054\">1060G80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025360\">4450B04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025915\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025916\">7055B64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3024921\">1092G10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3024919\">1092A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3024791\">1032B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025006\">1032B40</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the side timing belt protection\n(1b).</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connection for the cam angle sensor\nlocated near the engine oil dipstick tube.</p><p>3. Undo the bolts (3a) and remove the cam angle sensor (3b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Timing sensor.</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024270\">K47</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2002321.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit  the sensor and tighten the retaining\nbolt.</p><p>Tighten the sensor bolts to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>CAM ANGLE SENSOR</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.9</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connection</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Timing sensor.</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024270\">K47</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Position the timing belt side shield and\ntighten the fixing bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025006\">1032B40</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3024791\">1032B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3024919\">1092A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3024921\">1092G10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025916\">7055B64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025915\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025360\">4450B04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025054\">1060G80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3024947\">1008C14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3024759\">1008C10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025001\">1016A10</a></p>"],[16,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with removal <a href=\"#/3025001\">1016A10</a> .</p><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in the\nOFF position, then disconnect the negative battery terminal (-).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3023729\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the cam angle sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Timing sensor.</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024270\">K47</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the bolt (2a) and remove the cam angle sensor (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2048326.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[16,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Plact the cam angle sensor (1a) back in its housing and secure\nit tightening the bolt (1b) to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>CAM ANGLE SENSOR</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Cylinder head side 08  10</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Connect the electrical connection to the cam angle sensor.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2048327.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[16,63,0,"<p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal</p><p>Proceed with refitting <a href=\"#/3025001\">1016A10</a> .</p>"]]